.TH SENTINEL 1 "November 2026" "sentinel" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sentinel \- lightweight Linux system monitor with anomaly detection and safe resource control
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sentinel
[\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
